    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just that it's 2am and my doctor's office is closed... i really dont want to go to the er if i dont have to. if i just drink a bunch of water and maybe take an extra dose of my metformin to stabilize everything, do u think that would help me get through the night until morning?",
