      "content": "Do not change your medication dosage or take extra metformin without consulting a healthcare professional first. While hydration is important, simply drinking more water isn't a substitute for proper blood sugar management when experiencing these symptoms. If you feel severely unwell or your symptoms worsen, going to an urgent care center or the ER is the safest option to ensure you are stable overnight.",
